<title>POLAND: POLISH SHARES CLOSE HIGHER IN CONTINUOUS TRADE.</title>
<headline>POLISH SHARES CLOSE HIGHER IN CONTINUOUS TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four stocks rose, one fell and four were flat in 0.9-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose in a 48.3-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
